---
// What follows a list page's heading on the deep field (Feature 009 #281; spec #280 "What follows
// a list's heading"; ListHeading.astro): the filter form where the list has one, the cards or the
// empty state, and the pager, 32 px apart. The block starts 64 px above the field's lower edge
// below `sm` and 88 px from `sm`, in the room the heading leaves there, so it lies over the edge.
// It is positioned, so it is drawn in front of the field, which is positioned too.
---

<div class="page-container relative -mt-16 flex flex-col gap-8 pb-16 sm:-mt-22 lg:pb-20">
	<slot />
</div>
